      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1206. 你们校园的面积有多大？作必要的测量和计算."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1207",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1207. 利用标杆和直角器在地上作一长方形，使它的长为20",
        "米，宽为15米."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1208",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1208. 用标杆和直角器在地面上作一个长方形. 测量所作的",
        "长方形的长和宽. 测量结果精确到分米，并计算周长",
        "和面积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1209",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1209. 求你自己的步长. 为此需要用卷尺或其它测量仪器测",
        "量出地面上一个线段的长度，然后看看在这个线段上",
        "你要走多少步，再计算你每步的平均长度."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1210",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1210. 步测从你家到学校的距离，利用已知的自己每步的长",
        "度求出这段距离（以米计）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1211",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1211. 画出你家的一个房间的近似平面图，比例尺为1:50，",
        "以米为单位进行测量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1212",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1212. 测量任意地段并画出它的平面图，取1:250的比例尺."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1213",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1213. 列一个表，把你的步距换算成米. 在一栏内写步数，另",
        "一栏内写相应的米数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "65. 难度较大的问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1214",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1214. 末位数是几：",
        "1）$26\\cdot27\\cdot28\\cdot29+51\\cdot52\\cdot53\\cdot54$的和；",
        "2）$41\\cdot43\\cdot45\\cdot47-37\\cdot39\\cdot41\\cdot42$的差；",
        "3）从7到81全部自然数的积；",
        "4）全部三位数的和."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1215",
